  "label": "Microaggression",
  "description": "A subtle, often unintentional, comment or behavior that communicates hostile or derogatory messages to marginalized groups. The meme’s use of a tanning joke to deflect from racial bias can be considered a form of microaggression because it trivializes a serious social issue by reducing it to a superficial characteristic.",
